        "step_number": 1,
        "title": "Prep",
        "body": "Trim the beans, slice the mushrooms, garlic, ginger, and scallions. Stir together the soy sauce, rice vinegar, sugar, chili bean paste, cornstarch, and water. Rinse the rice. About 15 minutes.",
